# S3 Public Access Block Validation (Sprint 5)

## Objective
Ensure that the S3 bucket is not publicly accessible and complies with AWS security best practices.

## Command Used
aws s3api get-public-access-block --bucket ser517-monitoring-bucket-team5 --region us-east-2 --output table

## Steps Performed
- Retrieved S3 public access block configuration using AWS S3 API.
- Verified that all public access settings are enabled.
- Confirmed that the bucket is not publicly exposed.
- Validated IAM permissions required for public access configuration retrieval.

## Result
Successfully confirmed that public access block is enabled for the S3 bucket.
